hUGEDriver - public domain

The files in this directory (hUGEDriver_gb.o, hUGEDriver_duck.o,
hUGEDriver.h) are hUGEDriver by SuperDisk, unmodified:

    https://github.com/SuperDisk/hUGEDriver

Its author dedicates hUGETracker and hUGEDriver to the public domain (upstream
README: "hUGETracker and hUGEDriver are dedicated to the public domain.").
README.md in this directory records which release each object is and where it
came from (the Mega Duck object via https://github.com/gbdk-2020/CrossZGB).
